# Needs a rewrite: rules that differ only in condition can be joined with OR.
SUBJECT employee, contractor
RESOURCE hr_portal SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE vpn_gateway SUPPORTS EXECUTE

ALLOW employee READ hr_portal WHEN in_office
ALLOW employee READ hr_portal WHEN on_vpn
ALLOW employee WRITE hr_portal WHEN in_office AND mfa
ALLOW contractor EXECUTE vpn_gateway WHEN badge_valid
ALLOW contractor EXECUTE vpn_gateway WHEN escorted
